      "statement": "The builder's site-template SitePage requires every generated site to implement detectState(), regions(), and visibleData(). The template version is intentionally unconfigured: detectState returns 'unknown', and assertReady throws NOT_CONFIGURED, signalling what must be filled in via BUILD_REQUIRED comments.",
