    {
      "id": "claim_f3dc9d835fa846c49e5bcf5c868d456e",
      "statement": "POM transitions are of two kinds: in-page actions (filter submission, pagination, modal open/close) that keep the agent in the same state, and cross-POM transitions (search to results to detail, detail to versions) that navigate to a different page-object instance. Cross-POM transitions are POM methods that return a new POM instance, e.g. SearchPage.search() returns SearchResultsPage, SearchResultsPage.openCard() returns CardDetailPage, CardVersionsPage.openArtwork() returns CardDetailPage.",
