      "id": "claim_212465ce1736492aabb24ca3526835b2",
      "statement": "SitePage provides the shared base for all cardmarket POMs with three core responsibilities: assertReady (origin guard, Cloudflare detection, account key), gotoAllowed (navigate with origin + Cloudflare guards), and waitForCloudflare (poll page title, throw HUMAN_REQUIRED if challenge persists beyond 90 s).",
