    {
      "id": "claim_de286078856647fc89cccbd1ac33f978",
      "statement": "URL construction in url.ts uses string-based parsing (no WHATWG URL global) because the Playwright CLI browser runtime is a minimal VM. resolveHref resolves relative/absolute hrefs against the base URL. Origin validation in guards.ts (navigate, allowedURL) checks config.allowedOrigins before and after page.goto. parse.ts provides locale-tolerant parsers: parseQty strips non-digits, parsePrice normalizes comma decimal separators.",
